---
import Button from '../components/Button.astro'
import { mdiArrowRight } from '@mdi/js'
---

<div class="landing">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">AUTOMATED SOFTWARE ENGINEERING REVIEW</p>
    <h1>Find the crimes<br /> the clanker left behind.</h1>
    <p class="description">
      Clanker Crimes gives you a fully functional software project written by an AI. Your job is to
      investigate the repository, inspect the code, and identify the engineering crimes hiding
      inside it.
    </p>
    <p class="description">The applications work. The code is where things go wrong.</p>
    <a class="start" href="/case?repo=alpha">
      <Button icon={mdiArrowRight} label="Get started" ariaLabel="Get started" />
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class="briefing">
    <div class="briefing-line">
      <span class="label">OBJECTIVE</span>
      <span>Inspect the repository. Find the crimes. Submit your verdict. Continue to the end.</span
      >
    </div>
    <div class="briefing-line">
      <span class="label">RULES</span>
      <span>
        Everything is fair game. Download the application, inspect the repository, or run the
        preview when available.
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="briefing-line">
      <span class="label">DIFFICULTY</span>
      <span
        >Some crimes are obvious. Some are hiding in plain sight. Some are so stupid you would never
        think to look for them.</span
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .landing {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 7rem 2rem 5rem;
  }
  .hero {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }
  .description {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .start {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .start :global(button) {
    min-width: 10rem;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    background: var(--color-brand);
    border-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .start :global(button:hover) {
    background: var(--color-brand-strong);
    border-color: var(--color-brand-strong);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .briefing {
    margin-top: 7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .briefing-line {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .landing {
      padding: 4rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .briefing-line {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>
